# The same triple twice. sh:maxCount counts value nodes, not statements, so this
# must still conform. A validator that counts SPARQL solutions gets it wrong.
<http://ex.org/alice> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://ex.org/Person> .
<http://ex.org/alice> <http://ex.org/name> "Alice" .
<http://ex.org/alice> <http://ex.org/name> "Alice" .
